   runs        : 1 -- opus_health_legacy_v4
   payload     : 9 attribute(s), NULL-PADDED TO THE SATELLITE
   grain       : ONE ROW PER HUB_FINANCIAL_TRANSACTION_HK
   hashdiff    : SAT_FINTXN_CLAIM_PAYMENT_HASHDIFF (builder decision BD1), GUARDED against an all-null input (s5.5):
                 without the guard every all-null row hashes to ONE value and the
